{"unit_id":"systemsssx__dsh-project-hub#feature-feature-project-list","repo":"systemsssx/dsh-project-hub","commit":"97c1be4115b4fd8dc3784ffcdb5e3d768b2168da","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"项目工坊 的功能「项目登记」：创建项目并写入工作区花名册，同时建立档案目录与默认标签目录。可从侧栏的新建项目表单触发，输入项目名称、标识和标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2589","lib/doc-manager.js:254"]}
